              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jude 7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suddenly the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rained burning sulphur on the cities of Sodom and Gomorrah ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and destroyed them and the whole valley, along with all the people there and everything that grew on the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 17.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Lot's wife looked back and was turned into a pillar of salt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Early the next morning Abraham hurried to the place where he had stood in the presence of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He looked down at Sodom and Gomorrah and the whole valley and saw smoke rising from the land, like smoke from a huge furnace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when God destroyed the cities of the valley where Lot was living, he kept Abraham in mind and allowed Lot to escape to safety.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because Lot was afraid to stay in Zoar, he and his two daughters moved up into the hills and lived in a cave. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elder daughter said to her sister, “Our father is getting old, and there are no men in the whole world",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the whole world",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "this land.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to marry us so that we can have children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come on, let's make our father drunk, so that we can sleep with him and have children by him.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That night they gave him wine to drink, and the elder daughter had intercourse with him. But he was so drunk that he didn't know it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The next day the elder daughter said to her sister, “I slept with him last night; now let's make him drunk again tonight, and you sleep with him. Then each of us will have a child by our father.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So that night they made him drunk, and the younger daughter had intercourse with him. Again he was so drunk that he didn't know it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In this way both of Lot's daughters became pregnant by their own father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elder daughter had a son, whom she named Moab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.37",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Moab",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name sounds like the Hebrew for “from my father”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He was the ancestor of the present-day Moabites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The younger daughter also had a son, whom she named Benammi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19.38",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Benammi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name in Hebrew means “son of my relative” and sounds like the Hebrew for “Ammonite”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He was the ancestor of the present-day Ammonites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.19.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
